#Block 3 — Color by position":[163,177],"##Block 3 — Color by position#{1}":[165,166],"##Block 3 — Color by position#1\\. Select the chart → Format visual → Data colors.":[167,168],"##Block 3 — Color by position#2\\. You’ll see one color swatch per Position measure. Set:":[169,173],"##Block 3 — Color by position#2\\. You’ll see one color swatch per Position measure. Set:#{1}":[171,171],"##Block 3 — Color by position#2\\. You’ll see one color swatch per Position measure. Set:#{2}":[172,173],"##Block 3 — Color by position#3\\. Turn the legend off (Format visual → Legend → Show = Off).":[174,177],"##Block 3 — Color by position#3\\. Turn the legend off (Format visual → Legend → Show = Off).#{1}":[176,177],"##Wiring it up in the report":[178,198],"##Wiring it up in the report#{1}":[180,183],"##Wiring it up in the report#Build (or rebind) the chart:":[184,189],"##Wiring it up in the report#Build (or rebind) the chart:#{1}":[186,186],"##Wiring it up in the report#Build (or rebind) the chart:#{2}":[187,187],"##Wiring it up in the report#Build (or rebind) the chart:#{3}":[188,189],"##Wiring it up in the report#Add the selector slicer:":[190,194],"##Wiring it up in the report#Add the selector slicer:#{1}":[192,192],"##Wiring it up in the report#Add the selector slicer:#{2}":[193,194],"##Wiring it up in the report#Colors & legend — see Block 3 above.":[195,198],"##Wiring it up in the report#Colors & legend — see Block 3 above.#{1}":[197,198],"##Optional — a custom tooltip":[199,260],"##Optional — a custom tooltip#{1}":[201,253],"##Optional — a custom tooltip#{2}":[254,254],"##Optional — a custom tooltip#{3}":[255,255],"##Optional — a custom tooltip#{4}":[256,256],"##Optional — a custom tooltip#{5}":[257,258],"##Optional — a custom tooltip#{6}":[259,260],"##Quick test checklist":[261,271],"##Quick test checklist#{1}":[263,264],"##Quick test checklist#{2}":[265,265],"##Quick test checklist#{3}":[266,266],"##Quick test checklist#{4}":[267,267],"##Quick test checklist#{5}":[268,26